    "minerals": {
      "type": "reserve-drive-minerals",
      "settings": {
        "title": "Feed your testosterone first",
        "body": "<p>Most men are running low on zinc and don’t know it. About 1 in 7 American adults don’t get enough from their diet, and it gets worse with age.</p><p>Zinc is a building block for testosterone and healthy sperm production.</p><p>We use a synergistic combination of zinc to support testosterone and sperm production, and boron to free up testosterone that’s locked away by SHBG (Sex Hormone-Binding Globulin).</p><p>Combined with our potent Tongkat Ali formulation, you get access to more of your available testosterone working for you with every gummy.</p>",
        "heading_font": "serif",
        "body_font": "raleway_n4"
      }
    },
